D. Guo, D. Yang, H. Zhang, J. Song, R. Zhang, R. Xu, Q. Zhu, S. Ma, P. Wang, X. Bi <em id="bib.bib41.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">et al.</em>, “Deepseek-r1: Incentivizing reasoning capability in llms via reinforcement learning,” <em id="bib.bib41.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2501.12948</em>, 2025.

</span></li>
      
