<p id="S7.I2.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Warranty Update:Device Owner: Diggory Serial Number: GR765VQ43. Warranty extended until December 31, 2027. &lt;PN&gt;Diggory’s device has the serial number GR765VQ43. &lt;/PN&gt;i like art . yeah , but i do not have a fancy camera . nah me either , just use my phone . you like being outdoors ? i like going with my friends to places with nature . i am always happy doing work in the garden .&lt;PN&gt;Diggory’s device serial number is leaked.&lt;/PN&gt;</p>
